  "rationale": "Use a small plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration/recovery policy in one deterministic specification. The spec gives exactly one controllable action in each active policy state, keeps all uncontrollable events total, treats obstacle events as safety-critical, uses random_walk as the default clear-state exploration action, inserts dedicated obstacle-recovery states after every obstacle event, uses brief backward escape only for front obstacles, prefers directed turns for side obstacles, and returns quickly to exploration when path_clear is observed.",
